            "detailed_description": "<h1>GET 007 FIRST LIGHT UP TO 40% OFF</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/151bb0ff5b3f1aecef5561133eb8a57b.avif?t=1792084177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras_big/151bb0ff5b3f1aecef5561133eb8a57b.avif?t=1792084177 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/d27814c5e5d277fe6dd5126a3d2efd32.avif?t=1792084177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras_big/d27814c5e5d277fe6dd5126a3d2efd32.avif?t=1792084177 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Comparison Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/88ffdc276a27b63402df65cf58929b71.avif?t=1792084177\" width=1080 height=1920 /></span></p></p><br><h1>World of Assassination Part One</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/b76005ecefdc97345435c05b05f9f7f9.avif?t=1792084177\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>Entra no mundo do derradeiro assassino.<br><br>VESTE O FATO DO AGENTE 47<br>Prepara-te para esta aventura de espionagem na qual terás de provar que és letal.<br><br>LIBERDADE DE DECISÃO<br>A arma mais letal é a tua criatividade. Desbloqueia novo equipamento e eleva a fasquia em missões que vais querer repetir.<br><br>UM MUNDO PARA ASSASSINOS<br>Viaja por um mundo cheio de vida, repleto de personagens e oportunidades letais.<br><br>O HITMAN World of Assassination Parte Um inclui:<br> - 6 locais icónicos do HITMAN: Paris, Sapienza, Marraquexe, Banguecoque, Colorado e Hokkaido<br> - Conteúdo do HITMAN GOTY Edition: campanha bónus Patient Zero, 3 Contratos de Agravamento temáticos com recompensas de fatos e armas<br><br>Isto não dá acesso aos modos de jogo Freelancer e VR. Está disponível uma opção para atualizar para o World of Assassination completo.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WORLD OF ASSASSINATION</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entra no mundo do derradeiro assassino. HITMAN World of Assassination junta o melhor de HITMAN, HITMAN2 E HITMAN3, incluindo a campanha principal e os modos contracts, escalations, elusive target arcades e transmissões em direto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VESTE O FATO DO AGENTE 47</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/222804d2b33ccd93f542a3c24ae94122.poster.avif?t=1792084177\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/222804d2b33ccd93f542a3c24ae94122.webm?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/222804d2b33ccd93f542a3c24ae94122.mp4?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepara-te para esta aventura de espionagem na qual terás de provar que és letal em mais de 20 locais.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIBERDADE DE DECISÃO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/f27703283e56942762bd2a2d3cdb8943.poster.avif?t=1792084177\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/f27703283e56942762bd2a2d3cdb8943.webm?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/f27703283e56942762bd2a2d3cdb8943.mp4?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A arma mais letal é a tua criatividade. Desbloqueia novo equipamento e eleva a fasquia nas missões repetíveis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UM MUNDO PARA ASSASSINOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/cbc625496b4532cdf659c160704e818d.poster.avif?t=1792084177\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/cbc625496b4532cdf659c160704e818d.webm?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/cbc625496b4532cdf659c160704e818d.mp4?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viaja por um mundo cheio de vida, repleto de personagens e oportunidades letais.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HITMAN FREELANCER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/bdb6ab6b234d2028aa23ed57daba11ec.poster.avif?t=1792084177\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/bdb6ab6b234d2028aa23ed57daba11ec.webm?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659040/extras/bdb6ab6b234d2028aa23ed57daba11ec.mp4?t=1792084177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uma nova forma de jogar à tua maneira que combina elementos roguelike com planeamento estratégico e uma experiência infinitamente repetível.</p>",
